          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in attacks or perceived risk in key sea lanes raises insurance and transport costs and prompts investors to delay or redirect FDI in export-oriented and import-dependent projects, reducing cross-border investment flows between blocs (including US↔China) within investment decision cycles." />
          <attvalue for="36" value="6-18 months" />
