          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in coercive_escalation (more intense cross‑border kinetic, paramilitary or hybrid operations) elevates geopolitical risk and term premiums, pushing up nominal sovereign yields across maturities as investors price higher risk and potential economic disruption." />
