          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Increased kinetic and hybrid operations tied to the Russia‑Ukraine war (attacks on ports, mine‑laying, naval skirmishes, or proxy strikes) raises observable risks to vessels and crews in adjacent sea lanes and can spill over into chokepoints used by Middle Eastern energy shipping." />
