          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Widespread and sustained sanctions regimes against Russia normalize stricter licensing, expanded control lists and enforcement capacity, prompting governments to tighten export controls on sensitive technologies that could flow to China." />
