          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Interruptions or volatility in cross‑border energy infrastructure (e.g., pipeline closures, damaged export terminals, or constrained shipping from Black Sea corridors) force traders and tankers to divert cargoes to alternative routes, ports or suppliers at an accelerated pace." />
