          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Tightening export controls immediately blocks transactions and raises compliance/legal risk, prompting foreign investors, banks and trading partners to pause or withdraw capital and trade finance to affected firms and jurisdictions, reducing net cross-border capital flows." />
