          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in policy interest rates raises domestic borrowing and refinancing costs for upstream producers and service contractors, delaying maintenance and new field investment and thereby reducing near‑term crude output availability." />
