          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An upward shift in the nominal yield curve increases financing and collateral costs for inventory and hedging, destabilising storage economics and futures positions and producing larger, more frequent swings in energy prices." />
