          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained upward shift in the nominal yield curve raises long‑term borrowing costs unevenly across allied economies, producing asymmetric fiscal pressures and timetables that generate political disagreements and reduce operational synchronization within coalitions." />
