          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A marked rise in nominal yields (higher curve level) raises sovereign and corporate funding stress and market volatility, which market participants interpret as heightened economic fragility and elevate perceived geopolitical risk between major powers." />
