          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained inflow of new capital into AI-driven investment raises domestic demand, wages in high‑growth sectors and near‑term inflation expectations, prompting central banks to tighten policy rates to counter rising inflationary pressure." />
