          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in high-profile AI safety/security incidents drives immediate re‑risking as investors sell technology and growth equities and reallocate toward bonds and cash to avoid regulatory, litigation and operational losses." />
