          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="High-profile AI-related incidents (autonomous-weapon malfunctions, AI-driven cyberattacks on infrastructure) that can be attributed to conflict actors prompt rapid punitive responses, including expanded multilateral sanctions and export controls." />
